<h2>Asobi 0.9 (build 866)</h2>
<ul>
<li>A person&#8217;s row in Share This Review has <b>Send them a package&#8230;</b> in its Copy menu &#8212; a bundle of the session delivered to the review under their name, the pivot for someone on a slow connection.</li>
<li>The Review Manager&#8217;s record and its CSV keep each person&#8217;s connection.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
